#: /home/visago/Desktop/olvid/nextcloud-olvid/src/views/ProfileView.vue:176
msgid ""
"If you changed phone without transferring Olvid, uninstalled the app or "
"deleted your profile, your Nextcloud account is still linked to a profile "
